issue.body:
Is it possible to display higher-level flags in a subcommand?

e.g., given:

```go
app := &cli.App{
  Flags: []cli.Flag{
    cli.BoolFlag{
      Name: "verbose, v",
      Usage: "be LOUD",
    },
  },
  Commands: []cli.Command{
    cli.Command{
      Name: "status",
    },
  },
}
```

Is it possible for `verbose` to be displayed in `status`'s help command without redefining the flag?
